The tail sum decreases monotonically in $N$. Exponential bracketing followed by binary search uses $O(m\log(N_*+1))$ direct tail evaluations for $m$ modes and minimal valid ceiling $N_*$. A coarse closed form follows from $\sum_iq_i^{N+1}\le m\rho^{N+1}$.
